activation	Print prompt	2026-10-28T03:56:33.9212768Z # DuckDB completeness triage
activation	Print prompt	2026-10-28T03:56:33.9212978Z 
activation	Print prompt	2026-10-28T03:56:33.9213275Z Use the exact skill provided below. Its source path and hash are recorded in the
